{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/8b696f255bd1b52727481250d2a741ff.poster.avif?t=1762334853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/8b696f255bd1b52727481250d2a741ff.webm?t=1762334853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Some truths were never meant to be buried.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore uncharted lands. Excavate ancient ruins. Inspect every fragment with care \u2014 and record your findings before the sands reclaim them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a 19th-century archaeologist and uncover the echoes of civilizations long forgotten. Every relic holds a secret, every inscription a story waiting to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/06a37cde0b25ffc31d3284abd93e16c2.poster.avif?t=1762334853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/06a37cde0b25ffc31d3284abd93e16c2.webm?t=1762334853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slow-paced, atmospheric puzzle-adventure grounded in real archaeological methods and inspired by authentic discoveries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles based on ancient scripts, align forgotten mechanisms, and decipher symbols left behind by civilizations long gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies \u2014 only exploration, mystery, and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this expedition alone or with friends, and share the thrill of discovery as you unveil secrets buried by time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/9b6adfe34788ec1b0aa02e4ae5a7bfc5.poster.avif?t=1762334853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/9b6adfe34788ec1b0aa02e4ae5a7bfc5.webm?t=1762334853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/9b6adfe34788ec1b0aa02e4ae5a7bfc5.mp4?t=1762334853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every discovery can be measured in gold or glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you examine tablets, masks, and relics from lost civilizations, you\u2019ll uncover connections that reshape history itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each object is a fragment of a larger truth \u2014 waiting to be understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f<strong>Authentic Exploration</strong> \u2013 Traverse breathtaking excavation sites inspired by real 19th-century expeditions and archaeological history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Artifact Interpretation</strong> \u2013 Examine relics, tools, and pottery to uncover how ancient civilizations lived, created, and evolved \u2014 every object holds a clue to humanity\u2019s transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Manipulate light, align ancient devices, and restore long-dormant machinery to unlock sealed chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Linguistic Discovery</strong> \u2013 Decipher authentic ancient scripts and reconstruct fragments of humanity\u2019s earliest knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Optional Co-op Expeditions</strong> \u2013 Join friends in shared exploration \u2014 or embark on your journey into the unknown alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Evolving Mystery</strong> \u2013 Every discovery leads deeper into a truth time tried to erase \u2014 until silence itself becomes your final puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953020?t=1762334853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/3d82972e4d7c4e65660618c11a074ad1aab6541e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762334853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/81c5ef1fef4a318babf57a9bbe8a82c5ebd0ffb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762334853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/81c5ef1fef4a318babf57a9bbe8a82c5ebd0ffb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762334853","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Famil